        <mxCell id="E1a" value="-id: ObjectId&#xa;-userId: ObjectId&#xa;-email: string&#xa;-fullName: string" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="E1">
          <mxGeometry y="30" width="220" height="70" as="geometry" />
